WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:02.461
Switching Claude accounts, again?

00:06.200 --> 00:08.768
Meet Hatstand. One hat per client.

00:11.500 --> 00:17.444
Every client gets their own Claude profile. Side by side, with nothing leaking between them.

00:19.400 --> 00:23.426
See what each account is working on, right from its profile page.

00:24.500 --> 00:29.280
And every profile keeps its own second brain. Claude writes the notes as you work,

00:29.280 --> 00:34.010
and the graph shows how it all connects. It even finds the links you missed.

00:36.400 --> 00:39.714
Open any note, and edit it right inside Hatstand.

00:41.400 --> 00:45.572
Back it all up to your note-taking app, or undo everything in one click.

00:46.500 --> 00:50.019
Hatstand. Free and open source, for Mac and Windows.
